      "page": 265,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1866,
      "text": "We have come to you with the truth, and we are certainly truthful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 64,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 265,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1867,
      "text": "So travel with your household in the dark of night and go behind them; none of you should look back[31], and keep going to where you are commanded.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 65,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 265,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1868,
      "text": "We conveyed this decree to him that these [people] will be exterminated by early morning.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
